questions.question:
Construct the CFG generating the language accepted by the following PDA: M = ({ q0,q1 }, {0,1}, {Z0,X}, δ, q0, Z0, φ), where δ is given below:

δ(q0, 1, Z0) = {(q0, X Z0)}
δ(q0, 1, X)  = {(q0, X X)}
δ(q0, 0, X)  = {(q1, X)}
δ(q0, ε, Z0) = {(q0, ε)}
δ(q1, 1, X)  = {(q1, ε)}
δ(q1, 0, Z0) = {(q0, Z0)}

